  "content": "<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2GB3QhtXb4I?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br><span style=\"color:#f00\">需要 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore</a></span></p>\n<p><span>本模组最初由 SonicJumper 创建（原帖位于 </span><a style=\"background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/wip-mods/1442984-1-6-2-enhanced-visuals-v0-3-deprecated-updated-8\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a><span>）。</span></p>\n<p>EnhancedVisuals 通过为 HUD 添加特效，提供更沉浸式的游戏体验。</p>\n<p><strong>Optifine</strong><br>为了在 Optifine 旁边使用 EnhancedVisuals，必须关闭快速渲染（Fast Render）、各向异性过滤（Anisotropic Filtering）和抗锯齿（Antialiasing）。否则，当某些特效激活时，您的屏幕可能会变黑。</p>\n<p><strong>资源包<br></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/enhancedvisual-pixelated\" rel=\"nofollow\">EnhancedVisuals 像素版</a><br>(已过时) 由 nox_cgt 制作的像素版 EnhancedVisuals <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.dropbox.com%252fs%252fhiypntguq6ry40h%252fPixelated%2bEnhancedVisuals%2bby%2bnox_cgt.zip%253fdl%253d1\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">正在寻找一个与朋友一起游玩的服务器？我们的赞助商为您提供支持：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fteamcreative\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" width=\"237\" height=\"77\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">使用促销代码 <strong>teamcreative</strong> 可在任何游戏服务器上享受首月 25% 的折扣！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Y8zkibd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"377\" height=\"212\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/5OFKGb1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"378\" height=\"213\"></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/tough-as-nails\" rel=\"nofollow\">ToughAsNails</a>&nbsp;和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simpledifficulty\" rel=\"nofollow\">SimpleDifficulty</a> 的插件</strong></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/syjOViAN-N4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/creativemd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/g2vJewK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"263\" height=\"61\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/creativemd\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/W9QM3fS\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/YF5WrZ1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"154\" height=\"75\"></a></p>",
